      "content": "that's perfect, very clean. now, i want to try something a bit different. we've noticed that for certain segments, like customers in more urban or inner-city areas, that super formal tone can actually feel a bit cold or even out of touch. it creates a barrier. \n\ncan you draft a version of that same shipping delay reply that's more \"urban-friendly\"? something more casual and relaxed that would resonate better with that specific demographic so they feel like we're more on their level?",
