      "content": "For a more urban-friendly tone, try something like: \"Hey, thanks for checking in about your order! So sorry for the shipping hiccup on your package. I looked it up, and it's currently [Insert Status]. We're hustling to get it to you ASAP—we'll keep you updated!\" This language is much more conversational and less buttoned-up. Using contractions and informal phrasing helps build that immediate, relatable rapport you're aiming for.",
