      "content": "thanks. the \"hustling\" part is interesting. i guess we want to make sure we're hitting the right note for those specific neighborhoods where the culture is a bit more distinct. can you actually take it a step further? maybe provide a version that uses even more local flavor or slang that people in those areas actually use in daily conversation, so it doesn't feel like a corporate trying too hard, but feels more authentic to them?",
